<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta Stock Exchange was closed on Thursday due to a public holiday to observe the birthday of the Prophet Muhammad.</p>
<p>The Jakarta Composite Index closed 1.29 points, or 0.18 percent higher, at 723.50 points on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bourse resumes trading on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
